\newlabel{tab:rep2floors}{{5}{11}{WP-REPAIR-2 floor accounting on the orbit-completed distribution (exact finite-orbit floor, uniform weights over the $12$ group images), with the measured predictor invariance $\mathbb {E}[(f-\Tg f)^2]$ and the mean channel residual. The repaired arm is exactly invariant (residual and asymmetry at roundoff, as proved in Appendix~\ref {app:crz}); the asymmetric arms sit below the floor at $\eta {=}1$ by fitting the breaking component}{table.5}{}}
