\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces Decision-rule comparison on the $120$ frozen candidates ($60$ per family), for the gate \emph  {as implemented} --- the corrected gate is compared separately in \S  \ref {sec:corrected} and changes the reading. Precision is the share of fired repairs that helped; recall the share of beneficial repairs that fired. The final row is \emph  {not} a rule: it averages the mismatched-group risk change over every candidate with no firing mask, so it is an unconditional stress test and not any gate's realised risk. It is undefined on graphs because no mismatched group exists there.}}{20}{table.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:decision}{{15}{20}{Decision-rule comparison on the $120$ frozen candidates ($60$ per family), for the gate \emph {as implemented} --- the corrected gate is compared separately in \S \ref {sec:corrected} and changes the reading. Precision is the share of fired repairs that helped; recall the share of beneficial repairs that fired. The final row is \emph {not} a rule: it averages the mismatched-group risk change over every candidate with no firing mask, so it is an unconditional stress test and not any gate's realised risk. It is undefined on graphs because no mismatched group exists there}{table.15}{}}
